const keyMap={KeyW:'forward',KeyS:'back',KeyA:'left',KeyD:'right',ArrowUp:'forward',ArrowDown:'back',ArrowLeft:'left',ArrowRight:'right',Space:'jump',ShiftLeft:'sneak',ShiftRight:'sneak',ControlLeft:'sprint',ControlRight:'sprint'};
export function setupControls(socket){const pressed=new Set();function release(){pressed.forEach(a=>socket.send({type:'control',action:a,pressed:false}));pressed.clear();}function set(action,isDown){if(!action)return;if(isDown&&pressed.has(action))return;if(!isDown&&!pressed.has(action))return;isDown?pressed.add(action):pressed.delete(action);socket.send({type:'control',action,pressed:isDown});}document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.target.matches('input,textarea'))return;const action=keyMap[e.code];if(action){e.preventDefault();set(action,true);}});document.addEventListener('keyup',e=>{const action=keyMap[e.code];if(action){e.preventDefault();set(action,false);}});document.querySelectorAll('[data-control]').forEach(btn=>{const a=btn.dataset.control;['pointerdown','touchstart'].forEach(ev=>btn.addEventListener(ev,e=>{e.preventDefault();set(a,true);}));['pointerup','pointerleave','touchend','touchcancel'].forEach(ev=>btn.addEventListener(ev,e=>{e.preventDefault();set(a,false);}));});document.getElementById('povFrame').addEventListener('contextmenu',e=>e.preventDefault());document.getElementById('povFrame').addEventListener('mousedown',e=>{if(e.button===0)socket.send({type:'pointer',button:'left'});if(e.button===2)socket.send({type:'pointer',button:'right'});});document.getElementById('stopBtn').addEventListener('click',()=>{release();socket.send({type:'stop_all'});});window.addEventListener('blur',release);document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.hidden)release();});return release;}
